{"about_the_game":"Slime Nomi is a pixelated platformer. Help Nomi collect potion ingredients with the help of unique mechanics in various hand-crafted levels.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934150/extras/c83c8036c912a464b55e5678bbc1eb39.poster.avif?t=1745753629\" width=600 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934150/extras/c83c8036c912a464b55e5678bbc1eb39.webm?t=1745753629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934150/extras/c83c8036c912a464b55e5678bbc1eb39.mp4?t=1745753629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934150/extras/a74fb0a5f91361fd6b237ab832c9d441.poster.avif?t=1745753629\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934150/extras/a74fb0a5f91361fd6b237ab832c9d441.webp?t=1745753629\" class=\"bb_img\" width=15 height=16 /></picture></span>A variety of unique mechanics<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934150/extras/a74fb0a5f91361fd6b237ab832c9d441.poster.avif?t=1745753629\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934150/extras/a74fb0a5f91361fd6b237ab832c9d441.webp?t=1745753629\" class=\"bb_img\" width=15 height=16 /></picture></span>: Over ten original mechanics! Each chapter brings a whole new experience to the player. Teleport potions, bubble gums, wisps that can pass through walls, shields, explosive bricks... the game is loaded with creative ideas.<br></li><li><span c